  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">注目！槍械 重製版</h1><hr><p><strong>注目！槍械 重製版</strong> 是原始《注目！槍械》模組包的完整重製作品。</p><p>以《注目》系列為基礎，這個全新版本從頭開始重新設計，專注於<strong>現代槍械、戰爭、工程與探索</strong>，提供更沉浸的遊戲體驗。</p><p>原始模組包以槍械與殭屍為主題，背景設定在末日世界。在這次重製版中，我們移除了殭屍，更加強化了軍事戰鬥、先進武器、載具與大規模戰役的核心玩法。</p><p>無論是單人遊玩或與朋友同樂，《注目！槍械 重製版》都將為您提供無數建造、自動化、探索與主宰戰場的機會。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050140/description_b4bb23f6-688f-407c-9380-f6cfed80412f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"394\"></p><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:left\">特色內容</h2><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>武器與戰爭</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics Zero (TACZ)</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superb-warfare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SuperB Warfare</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></strong></li>\n<li>額外武器包與軍事主題內容</li>\n<li>擴展的戰鬥機制與裝備</li>\n</ul><p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050140/description_aab5d257-e02a-4295-a8e5-f4eca4b858bc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"227\" height=\"227\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050140/description_98962afc-397c-461a-9a2d-3922c73a3b67.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"227\" height=\"227\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050140/description_64742ce3-c070-49e8-b573-3ae4814c9559.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"227\" height=\"227\"></p><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>機械動力與工程</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-aeronautics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Aeronautics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-big-cannons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Big Cannons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-steam-n-rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Steam &amp; Rails</a><br>建造工廠、載具、飛船與強大的火砲系統</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul><hr><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>世界生成與探索</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structory</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-cities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Lost Cities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towns-and-towers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towns and Towers</a><br>增強探索體驗，包含多樣化地貌與廢棄都市環境<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1050140/description_154df2fb-4f28-4db3-ace2-31316ec38d85.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"394\"><br><br><hr></li>\n</ul><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>裝飾與建築</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-deco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Deco</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong>以及更多精彩內容</strong></li>\n</ul><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>為什麼要玩《注目！槍械 重製版》？</strong></h2><ul>\n<li>\n<p>從前一版本完全重建</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>聚焦槍械、戰爭與工程</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>現代武器與火砲支援的大規模戰鬥</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>飛船與先進的機械動力機械</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>強化探索與世界生成</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>單人與多人連線皆宜</p>\n</li>\n<li><hr></li>\n</ul><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">由 _Stijn07 創作</h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">歡迎來到《注目！槍械》的次世代版本。<br>準備開戰</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540stijnonark%253fis_from_webapp%253d1%2526sender_device%253dpc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TikTok</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/_stijn07/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252f_Stijn07\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></p>",
